    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 25A of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, A. Ibathul Rauff Hakeem, theMinister of City Planning, Water Supply and Higher Education, having obtained a report under Section 70C of the aforesaidAct, in respect of the Saegis Campus (Private) Limited a company incorporated in Sri Lanka under the Companies Act,No. 07 of 2007 and bearing Registration Number PV 72548, do by this Order amend the Schedule II to the Order madeunder the Act, and published in Gazette Extraordinary, No. 2079/35 of July 11, 2018 by the addition immediately after theentry \u201cBachelor of Information Technology\u201d appearing in Column I and its corresponding entry in Column II thereof, ofthe entries specified under Column I and II respectively of the Schedule II hereto, subject to the conditions specified inSchedule I hereto :-",
